Scope
-----

This licence covers everything in this repository: the code under `src/` and
`data/get_data.py`, the result files under `results/`, the figures under
`figures/`, and the documentation.

It does not cover the datasets, none of which are redistributed here. The two
SNAP edge lists and the DBLP bibliographic data carry their own terms from
their original sources; see `data/README.md`.
